---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import { LAST_UPDATED } from "../lib/site";
---

<Page
  title="Cookie notice | Waymark"
  description="Waymark does not use advertising or tracking cookies."
  heading="Cookie notice"
  updated={LAST_UPDATED}
>
  <p>
    This website does not set advertising, analytics or tracking cookies, so we don't show a cookie banner.
  </p>
  <h2>What the study app stores on your device</h2>
  <p>
    The study app saves your progress, test date and settings in your browser's local storage so your plan works the
    next time you visit. This is strictly necessary for the service you asked for, never leaves your device, and is not
    used to track you. You can delete it in the app (Settings, then "Reset all progress") or by clearing your browser's
    site data.
  </p>
  <h2>If this changes</h2>
  <p>
    If we ever add analytics, we will update this page first, use a privacy-friendly tool, and give you a simple way to
    opt out.
  </p>
</Page>
